{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5471","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5471/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5471/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5471/events","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5471","id":52724562,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1MjcyNDU2Mg==","number":5471,"title":"3.0: __x function's `context` option is \"lost\"","user":{"login":"uniquexor","id":6176836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzY4MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6176836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uniquexor","html_url":"https://github.com/uniquexor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uniquexor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uniquexor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uniquexor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uniquexor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uniquexor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uniquexor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uniquexor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uniquexor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uniquexor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":60504396,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MDUwNDM5Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/labels/i18n","name":"i18n","color":"FFFFFF","default":false,"description":null},{"id":60504544,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MDUwNDU0NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/labels/defect","name":"defect","color":"e50f2c","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/milestones/7","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/milestone/7","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/milestones/7/labels","id":453043,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNDUzMDQz","number":7,"title":"3.0.0","description":"New major release that breaks compatibility with 2.x\r\n\r\n- PHP5.4.19+\r\n- New ORM & behaviors.\r\n- Improved Routing\r\n- PSR-0 and composer support.\r\n- Simpler configuration and bootstrapping.\r\n- Improved configuration handling.\r\n- Improved bake.\r\n\r\nSee [the roadmap](http://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/wiki/3.0-roadmap) for more details.","creator":null,"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":2464,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-10-11T20:56:23Z","updated_at":"2015-12-17T03:00:48Z","due_on":"2015-03-22T04:00:00Z","closed_at":"2015-03-23T01:02:41Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2014-12-23T09:05:00Z","updated_at":"2014-12-23T21:20:17Z","closed_at":"2014-12-23T21:20:17Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I'm not exactly sure, which package should be fixed, if it's the \\Aura\\Intl\\Translator or the __x function.\n\nThe problem is, that when you pass a `$context` variable to the __x function it passes it on to the selected translator:\n\n``` php\nreturn I18n::translator()->translate($singular, ['_context' => $context] + $arguments);\n```\n\nHowever, when \\Aura\\Intl\\Translator is used, the `_context` option is never checked in its `translate` method, which results in a translation not found, since the key in the translations lookup table looks like `[Context]\\x04[Key]` and it tries to find `[Key]` instead.\n","closed_by":{"login":"lorenzo","id":37621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.co